                  "editor": "<p style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; color:#E2E8F0; margin:0; font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight:400; max-width:820px;\">AXELA LTD. is a Bangladesh-focused trading, indenting, commercial brokerage and business advisory company. We connect buyers, suppliers, project owners and prospective investors to support product sourcing, supply requirements, tender opportunities and investment proposals.</p>",
